              <div class="privacy-footer-note">
                <p>
                  <i class="fas fa-lock" aria-hidden="true" style="margin-right:6px;opacity:0.6;"></i>
                  This Privacy Policy was last updated on <strong>January 29, 2026</strong> and is effective as of that date.
                  ZenoPay Financial Services Ltd. is registered and regulated in accordance with applicable financial services legislation.
                </p>
